# 01 Manual Testing – OpenCart Project

## Project Overview

This folder contains the **Manual Testing documentation and testing artifacts** created for the OpenCart E-commerce application.

The project covers the complete manual testing process, starting from understanding the requirements and preparing the test plan to test case execution, defect reporting, and requirement traceability.

## Application Under Test

**Application:** OpenCart E-commerce Website
**Testing Type:** Manual Testing

## Testing Activities

The following activities were performed as part of this project:

* Requirement Analysis
* Test Planning
* Test Scenario Creation
* Test Case Design
* Requirement Traceability
* Test Case Execution
* Defect Identification and Reporting
* Test Result Documentation

## Testing Areas

The test documentation covers important OpenCart functionalities such as:

* User Registration
* Login
* Logout
* Forgot Password
* Product Search
* Product Display
* Product Compare
* Wishlist
* Shopping Cart
* Checkout
* Account Management
* Address Book
* Order History
* Product Review
* Contact Us
* Return Request
* Other e-commerce functionalities

## Project Documents

| File                                         | Description                                                        |
| -------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| `Project_Introduction.pdf`                   | Introduction and overview of the project                           |
| `Open Cart FRS.pdf`                          | Functional Requirements Specification                              |
| `Test Plan.pdf`                              | Test planning document defining the testing approach               |
| `OpenCart Test Scenario and Test Cases.xlsx` | Test scenarios and detailed test cases                             |
| `RTM Open Cart.xlsx`                         | Requirement Traceability Matrix mapping requirements to test cases |
| `OpenCart Test Execution.xlsx`               | Test execution results and test status                             |
| `OpenCart-Bug Report.xlsx`                   | Defects identified during testing                                  |

## Test Case Design

Test cases were created to validate:

* Positive scenarios
* Negative scenarios
* Valid and invalid input
* Functional requirements
* Boundary conditions
* Error handling
* End-to-end user flows

## Defect Reporting

Identified defects were documented with relevant information such as:

* Bug ID
* Bug Title
* Description
* Steps to Reproduce
* Expected Result
* Actual Result
* Severity
* Priority
* Status

## RTM

The Requirement Traceability Matrix was created to ensure that the requirements are mapped with the corresponding test cases and that the required functionality is covered by testing.

## Test Execution

The prepared test cases were executed and the results were recorded with appropriate test statuses such as:

* Pass
* Fail
* Blocked
* Not Executed

## Skills Demonstrated

Through this project, I practiced:

* Manual Testing
* Functional Testing
* Test Scenario Creation
* Test Case Design
* Test Planning
* Test Execution
* Defect Reporting
* Requirement Traceability
* Positive & Negative Testing
* Regression Testing
* Retesting
* End-to-End Testing
* Excel for Test Management

